@@ -0,0 +1,1298 @@
+# type: ignore
+# BitBIRCH is an open-source clustering module based on iSIM
+#
+# Please, cite the BitBIRCH paper: https://doi.org/10.1039/D5DD00030K
+#
+# BitBIRCH is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify
